==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A straightforward stage with easy-to-beat peons and no major threats. The Sir Seal stacks may give you a bit of trouble, but with [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red units]] to complement your ranged attackers, you'll have an easy time nonetheless. Stalling strategies may still be used, but beware of the Zigge and Hippoe that appear after a minute or so.

